sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Kernel as kmain / Caller
    participant PIT as pit.cpp
    participant Ports as CPU Ports (0x43, 0x42, 0x61)
    participant Timer as 8254 Timer HW

    Kernel->>PIT: pit_sleep_ms(ms)
    loop For each millisecond (i = 0 .. ms)
        PIT->>Ports: outb(0x43, 0xB0) [Channel 2, Mode 0]
        PIT->>Ports: outb(0x42, 1193 & 0xFF) [Low byte]
        PIT->>Ports: outb(0x42, (1193 >> 8) & 0xFF) [High byte]
        PIT->>Ports: Toggle Port 0x61 (Gate bit 0: Clear then Set)
        Timer->>Timer: Counts down 1193 ticks at 1.193 MHz
        loop While bit 5 of 0x61 == 0
            PIT->>Ports: inb(0x61)
            PIT->>PIT: CPU 'pause'
        end
        Timer-->>Ports: Terminal count reached (Bit 5 becomes 1)
    end
    PIT-->>Kernel: Delay complete
